(b) For the purposes of clause (B), the thresholds limit shall be as under, -
(i) in the case of a multi-product or a multi services company (i.e. a company producing more than one product or
service), any product or a service for which the individual turnover (from such specific product or such specific service) is
rupees fifty crore or more;
(ii) in the case of a company, producing any one specific product or service, if the net worth of the company is rupees
one hundred and fifty crore or more or the turnover is rupees twenty five crore or more.
(c) in the case of companies engaged in an industry regulated by a sectoral regulator, the requirements of sectoral
regulator regarding cost records shall be taken into account.
(C) Companies operating in areas involving public interest such as:
